oices 17592186165727] [:db/retract 17592186165716 :answer-field/choices 17592186165717] [:db/retract 17592186165716 :answer-field/choices 17592186165718] [:db/retract 17592186165716 :answer-field/choices 17592186165719] [:db/retract 17592186165716 :answer-field/choices 17592186165720] [:db/retract 17592186165716 :answer-field/choices 17592186165721] [:db/retract 17592186165734 :answer-field/choices 17592186165735] [:db/retract 17592186165734 :answer-field/choices 17592186165736] [:db/retract 17592186165734 :answer-field/choices 17592186165737] [:db/retract 17592186165734 :answer-field/choices 17592186165738] [:db/retract 17592186165734 :answer-field/choices 17592186165739] {:db/id 17592186166802 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-e9856d89-c407-5a27-9255-59fdcff13d87" "question-2aefbec7-dbc4-5c5a-8816-9b24bf877b40" "question-d2739611-7ef4-5493-8191-67c702a22c88" "question-f63f0268-1410-54a1-bbf2-06e90b1cc575"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186166640 :question/problem "Calculate\n$\\displaystyle \\int 4\\sinh 2x \\cosh 2x \\, \\textrm{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the double-angle formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\sin {2\\theta}=2\\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the double-angle formula for the hyperbolic sine:\n\n$$\n\\sinh {2\\theta} =2\\sinh \\theta \\cosh \\theta\n$$\n\n \n\nLetting $\\theta= 2x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\sinh {4x} =2\\sinh 2x \\cosh 2x.\n$$\n\n \n\nRearranging the above formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{1}{2}\\sinh {4x}= \\sinh 2x \\cosh 2x.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 4\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 4\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int 2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4x+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186166803 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-1212fe46-96e8-51be-81fa-22f7749ff713" "question-7b5373c3-faa7-5442-9a9c-2d5aebc96c49" "question-216e3ef8-6751-5e3e-9d7f-5d48b7476c3e"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186166641 :question/problem "Calculate $\\displaystyle \\int \\cosh^2{x} + \\sinh^2{x}\\ \\, \\textrm{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine: \n\n$$\n\\cos{2x}= \\cos^2{x}-\\sin^2{x}\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cosh 2x = \\cosh^2{x} + \\sinh^2{x}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {cosh}^{2}⁡x+{sinh}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186166804 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-6b367b19-8f35-5f68-a044-eb7b9764c38d" "question-1ebb4c16-c258-518a-a825-ce276a761a9f" "question-cf4092b0-8e64-55b4-94ba-2a8ea4d2ac81" "question-12efb8aa-cbcc-5328-91fe-5d769b12ac7b"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186166642 :question/problem "Calculate $\\displaystyle \\int 2\\cosh^2 x \\, \\textrm{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine: \n\n$$\n\\cos{2x} =2\\cos^2 x -1.\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cosh{2x} =2\\cosh^2 x -1.\n$$\n\n \n\nRearranging, we have\n\n$$\n\\cosh^2 x = \\dfrac{1}{2} \\left(\\cosh 2x +1 \\right).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 2{cosh}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 2\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186166805 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-d0857a55-78b2-5e38-b682-a21c51974c3c" "question-1ddb9340-9af2-51a6-8581-bb4c21f42fab" "question-4b85bc81-6104-5328-b444-83c8973655d4" "question-bc295d1d-76d5-5f67-a844-a3b5be954577" "question-12bc09cc-29a3-5e9b-995b-e577844956a7"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186166643 :question/problem "Evaluate $\\displaystyle \\int_{0}^{\\ln 2} 8\\sinh^2{x} \\, \\textrm{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine: \n\n$$\n\\cos {2x}=1-2\\sin^2x.\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cosh{2x} = 1+ 2\\sinh^2{x}\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above formula as\n\n$$\n\\sinh^2x = \\dfrac{1}{2}\\left(\\cosh {2x} -1\\right ).\n$$\n\nWe can now integrate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}8{sinh}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}8\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x-1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}4\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x-4\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x-4x)\\,{|}_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2} \\\\  & =(2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)-4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)-(2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡0-4\\cdot 0) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{{e}^{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}-{e}^{-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}}{2}-4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2 \\\\  & =({2}^{2}-{2}^{-2})-4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2 \\\\  & =\\frac{15}{4}-4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-e9856d89-c407-5a27-9255-59fdcff13d87" :question/id #uuid "e9856d89-c407-5a27-9255-59fdcff13d87" :question/math-academy-id "q-165868" :question/problem "Calculate\n$\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡x(1-4\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the double-angle formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the double-angle formula for the hyperbolic sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x=2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡x(1-4\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-4\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-52fc9b93-f185-51cf-96c4-aa283889ea1c"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-52fc9b93-f185-51cf-96c4-aa283889ea1c" :answer-field/id #uuid "52fc9b93-f185-51cf-96c4-aa283889ea1c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-f3bce9db-26d5-50f0-9fe4-7ad7e1077c34" :answer-field/choices ["answer-629f2592-d6cf-5301-bbf9-afb67b52575e" "answer-bb52cde0-116a-5ae3-8699-649aef73ee30" "answer-f9569153-c468-5743-9137-49712beb9791" "answer-f3bce9db-26d5-50f0-9fe4-7ad7e1077c34" "answer-d25fcc9f-cb09-5a88-b65e-0642fa259c92"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-629f2592-d6cf-5301-bbf9-afb67b52575e" :answer/id #uuid "629f2592-d6cf-5301-bbf9-afb67b52575e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bb52cde0-116a-5ae3-8699-649aef73ee30" :answer/id #uuid "bb52cde0-116a-5ae3-8699-649aef73ee30" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f9569153-c468-5743-9137-49712beb9791" :answer/id #uuid "f9569153-c468-5743-9137-49712beb9791" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f3bce9db-26d5-50f0-9fe4-7ad7e1077c34" :answer/id #uuid "f3bce9db-26d5-50f0-9fe4-7ad7e1077c34" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d25fcc9f-cb09-5a88-b65e-0642fa259c92" :answer/id #uuid "d25fcc9f-cb09-5a88-b65e-0642fa259c92" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-2aefbec7-dbc4-5c5a-8816-9b24bf877b40" :question/id #uuid "2aefbec7-dbc4-5c5a-8816-9b24bf877b40" :question/math-academy-id "q-97002" :question/problem "$\\int 4\\operatorname{sinh}⁡3x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡3x\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡2\\theta =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the double-angle formula for the hyperbolic sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2\\theta =2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cosh}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\n \n\nLetting $\\theta =3x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡6x=2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡3x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡3x\\,⇒\\,\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡6x=\\operatorname{sinh}⁡3x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡3x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 4\\operatorname{sinh}⁡3x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡3x\\,\\text{d}x & =4\\int \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sinh}⁡6x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡6x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{6}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡6x+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡6x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4892020f-9c0a-596a-8e09-defba95af628"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4892020f-9c0a-596a-8e09-defba95af628" :answer-field/id #uuid "4892020f-9c0a-596a-8e09-defba95af628" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-311962ed-cf4b-50f6-8f93-b21a1ec37f44" :answer-field/choices ["answer-28bb8b58-58db-5c34-880f-98ca4d68e97f" "answer-311962ed-cf4b-50f6-8f93-b21a1ec37f44" "answer-038a0210-5971-59fa-acf9-ce1024737d67" "answer-c90c7879-69e2-53ab-8244-4eb0e833284a" "answer-0150030c-b66d-5338-9f85-6cd2ee3578f3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-28bb8b58-58db-5c34-880f-98ca4d68e97f" :answer/id #uuid "28bb8b58-58db-5c34-880f-98ca4d68e97f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡3x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-311962ed-cf4b-50f6-8f93-b21a1ec37f44" :answer/id #uuid "311962ed-cf4b-50f6-8f93-b21a1ec37f44" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡6x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-038a0210-5971-59fa-acf9-ce1024737d67" :answer/id #uuid "038a0210-5971-59fa-acf9-ce1024737d67" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡6x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c90c7879-69e2-53ab-8244-4eb0e833284a" :answer/id #uuid "c90c7879-69e2-53ab-8244-4eb0e833284a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡3x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0150030c-b66d-5338-9f85-6cd2ee3578f3" :answer/id #uuid "0150030c-b66d-5338-9f85-6cd2ee3578f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cosh}⁡6x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-d2739611-7ef4-5493-8191-67c702a22c88" :question/id #uuid "d2739611-7ef4-5493-8191-67c702a22c88" :question/math-academy-id "q-97004" :question/problem "$\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡7x(2-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡7x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡2\\theta =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the double-angle formula for the hyperbolic sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2\\theta =2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cosh}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\n \n\nLetting $\\theta =7x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡14x=2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡7x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡7x\\,⇒\\,\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡14x=\\operatorname{sinh}⁡7x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡7x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡7x(2-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡7x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡7x-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡7x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡7x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡7x-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡14x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡7x\\,\\text{d}x-\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡14x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{1}{7}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡7x-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{14}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡14x+C \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{7}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡7x-\\frac{1}{28}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡14x+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}(2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡7x-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡14x)+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-0174772c-e601-55be-94f4-65f166c6c8a2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-0174772c-e601-55be-94f4-65f166c6c8a2" :answer-field/id #uuid "0174772c-e601-55be-94f4-65f166c6c8a2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-47e95c0b-938e-5763-8319-8c104318e174" :answer-field/choices ["answer-a31c6409-3a2a-541f-a937-5134697763fd" "answer-47e95c0b-938e-5763-8319-8c104318e174" "answer-d8d92fab-f086-5ced-9eef-34e5e4a830aa" "answer-df8dd24b-0de1-55dc-806e-c2876017394b" "answer-fcc85635-96f4-5594-ba0d-743b2cf746b1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a31c6409-3a2a-541f-a937-5134697763fd" :answer/id #uuid "a31c6409-3a2a-541f-a937-5134697763fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{7}(2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡7x-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡14x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-47e95c0b-938e-5763-8319-8c104318e174" :answer/id #uuid "47e95c0b-938e-5763-8319-8c104318e174" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{7}(2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡7x-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡14x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d8d92fab-f086-5ced-9eef-34e5e4a830aa" :answer/id #uuid "d8d92fab-f086-5ced-9eef-34e5e4a830aa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{7}(2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡7x-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡7x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-df8dd24b-0de1-55dc-806e-c2876017394b" :answer/id #uuid "df8dd24b-0de1-55dc-806e-c2876017394b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{7}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡7x-2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡7x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fcc85635-96f4-5594-ba0d-743b2cf746b1" :answer/id #uuid "fcc85635-96f4-5594-ba0d-743b2cf746b1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{7}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡7x-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡14x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186167416 :question/problem "Calculate\n$\\int 6\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the double-angle formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the double-angle formula for the hyperbolic sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x=2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\n$$\n\nRearranging the above formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x=\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 6\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 6\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int 3\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+C \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186165704 :answer-field/correct "answer-94ebae54-04f0-58fd-a9a5-a9040950f083" :answer-field/choices ["answer-84a67ab8-b636-5da5-b6a5-ee31f890ea8d" "answer-7a602437-2d37-5f2e-b366-8d895bd5c242" "answer-bcc6778f-1df2-5400-8fe4-2f04db0ee255" "answer-94ebae54-04f0-58fd-a9a5-a9040950f083" "answer-a83347d4-c667-55f6-9a49-cbb6b61bd9d3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-84a67ab8-b636-5da5-b6a5-ee31f890ea8d" :answer/id #uuid "84a67ab8-b636-5da5-b6a5-ee31f890ea8d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7a602437-2d37-5f2e-b366-8d895bd5c242" :answer/id #uuid "7a602437-2d37-5f2e-b366-8d895bd5c242" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bcc6778f-1df2-5400-8fe4-2f04db0ee255" :answer/id #uuid "bcc6778f-1df2-5400-8fe4-2f04db0ee255" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-94ebae54-04f0-58fd-a9a5-a9040950f083" :answer/id #uuid "94ebae54-04f0-58fd-a9a5-a9040950f083" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a83347d4-c667-55f6-9a49-cbb6b61bd9d3" :answer/id #uuid "a83347d4-c667-55f6-9a49-cbb6b61bd9d3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-f63f0268-1410-54a1-bbf2-06e90b1cc575" :question/id #uuid "f63f0268-1410-54a1-bbf2-06e90b1cc575" :question/math-academy-id "q-96997" :question/problem "Calculate\n$\\int \\operatorname{cosh}⁡x(2+3\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the double-angle formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the double-angle formula for the hyperbolic sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x=2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\n$$\n\nRearranging the above formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x=\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{cosh}⁡x(2+3\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+3\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+3\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int \\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x+\\frac{3}{2}\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x+\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+C \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x+\\frac{3}{4}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-48bde9ee-22aa-5b03-8cfa-0dd37dae0e93"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-48bde9ee-22aa-5b03-8cfa-0dd37dae0e93" :answer-field/id #uuid "48bde9ee-22aa-5b03-8cfa-0dd37dae0e93" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-9f0efb8b-9b26-5242-b8a3-0bb76a38d966" :answer-field/choices ["answer-5c08b8f2-6ec1-5600-93e6-9f66c69f245a" "answer-0aa0176e-c098-5a31-a679-f78c82cde774" "answer-e08be13a-a49a-561a-b2a2-30db269c341d" "answer-9f0efb8b-9b26-5242-b8a3-0bb76a38d966" "answer-7b8d62c6-d563-54dc-adcf-ee55a3efdfc7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5c08b8f2-6ec1-5600-93e6-9f66c69f245a" :answer/id #uuid "5c08b8f2-6ec1-5600-93e6-9f66c69f245a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+3\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0aa0176e-c098-5a31-a679-f78c82cde774" :answer/id #uuid "0aa0176e-c098-5a31-a679-f78c82cde774" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x-\\frac{3}{4}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e08be13a-a49a-561a-b2a2-30db269c341d" :answer/id #uuid "e08be13a-a49a-561a-b2a2-30db269c341d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x+\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9f0efb8b-9b26-5242-b8a3-0bb76a38d966" :answer/id #uuid "9f0efb8b-9b26-5242-b8a3-0bb76a38d966" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x+\\frac{3}{4}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7b8d62c6-d563-54dc-adcf-ee55a3efdfc7" :answer/id #uuid "7b8d62c6-d563-54dc-adcf-ee55a3efdfc7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-1212fe46-96e8-51be-81fa-22f7749ff713" :question/id #uuid "1212fe46-96e8-51be-81fa-22f7749ff713" :question/math-academy-id "q-97017" :question/problem "${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }(2{cosh}^{2}⁡2x+2{sinh}^{2}⁡2x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta ={cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2\\theta ={cosh}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sinh}^{2}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =2x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4x={cosh}^{2}⁡2x+{sinh}^{2}⁡2x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }(2{cosh}^{2}⁡2x+2{sinh}^{2}⁡4x)\\,\\text{d}x & =2{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }({cosh}^{2}⁡2x+{sinh}^{2}⁡4x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4x\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi } \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4\\pi -\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡0 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-5ae402e9-62e8-57e1-bd92-31044e84dfce"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5ae402e9-62e8-57e1-bd92-31044e84dfce" :answer-field/id #uuid "5ae402e9-62e8-57e1-bd92-31044e84dfce" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c45f024d-5689-5adb-9c42-f9395e9c0cb3" :answer-field/choices ["answer-8cebce10-a6c9-5515-93f2-fa7b8b926abd" "answer-a4415743-8c2d-5029-baae-5ce1e6986656" "answer-c45f024d-5689-5adb-9c42-f9395e9c0cb3" "answer-f54d4a0c-06bf-5ce6-992a-91eb96c3cba9" "answer-0ded49d0-0325-529f-9419-2090bfab98aa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8cebce10-a6c9-5515-93f2-fa7b8b926abd" :answer/id #uuid "8cebce10-a6c9-5515-93f2-fa7b8b926abd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a4415743-8c2d-5029-baae-5ce1e6986656" :answer/id #uuid "a4415743-8c2d-5029-baae-5ce1e6986656" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c45f024d-5689-5adb-9c42-f9395e9c0cb3" :answer/id #uuid "c45f024d-5689-5adb-9c42-f9395e9c0cb3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f54d4a0c-06bf-5ce6-992a-91eb96c3cba9" :answer/id #uuid "f54d4a0c-06bf-5ce6-992a-91eb96c3cba9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0ded49d0-0325-529f-9419-2090bfab98aa" :answer/id #uuid "0ded49d0-0325-529f-9419-2090bfab98aa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186167419 :question/problem "${\\int }_{0}^{1}({cosh}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})+{sinh}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})+2x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta ={cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2\\theta ={cosh}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sinh}^{2}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =\\frac{x}{2},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x={cosh}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})+{sinh}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{2}).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}({cosh}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})+{sinh}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})+2x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+2x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={(\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x+{x}^{2})|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =[\\operatorname{sinh}⁡1+{1}^{2}]-[\\operatorname{sinh}⁡0+{0}^{2}] \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sinh}⁡1+1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186165722 :answer-field/correct "answer-c4e43ea6-56f9-53d9-be2b-45a9e8207c49" :answer-field/choices ["answer-89fa846f-c2dc-59c0-bbf7-8bcd7e2a6c99" "answer-9872ca05-e4a0-5b63-a020-31c95419fd24" "answer-0d3ae801-57c5-5791-9c38-7c7bf1661954" "answer-c4e43ea6-56f9-53d9-be2b-45a9e8207c49" "answer-d34fba1f-7a19-51e8-9fc1-a8d8f2c1ef38"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-89fa846f-c2dc-59c0-bbf7-8bcd7e2a6c99" :answer/id #uuid "89fa846f-c2dc-59c0-bbf7-8bcd7e2a6c99" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡1-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9872ca05-e4a0-5b63-a020-31c95419fd24" :answer/id #uuid "9872ca05-e4a0-5b63-a020-31c95419fd24" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡1-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0d3ae801-57c5-5791-9c38-7c7bf1661954" :answer/id #uuid "0d3ae801-57c5-5791-9c38-7c7bf1661954" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡1-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c4e43ea6-56f9-53d9-be2b-45a9e8207c49" :answer/id #uuid "c4e43ea6-56f9-53d9-be2b-45a9e8207c49" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sinh}⁡1+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d34fba1f-7a19-51e8-9fc1-a8d8f2c1ef38" :answer/id #uuid "d34fba1f-7a19-51e8-9fc1-a8d8f2c1ef38" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sinh}⁡1+\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-7b5373c3-faa7-5442-9a9c-2d5aebc96c49" :question/id #uuid "7b5373c3-faa7-5442-9a9c-2d5aebc96c49" :question/math-academy-id "q-165874" :question/problem "${\\int }_{0}^{1/3}(2{sinh}^{2}⁡3x+2{cosh}^{2}⁡3x-1)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta ={cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2\\theta ={cosh}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sinh}^{2}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =3x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡6x={cosh}^{2}⁡3x+{sinh}^{2}⁡3x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }(2{sinh}^{2}⁡3x+2{cosh}^{2}⁡3x-1)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/3}(2({cosh}^{2}⁡3x+{sinh}^{2}⁡3x)-1)\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/3}(2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡6x-1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡6x-x){|}_{0}^{1/3} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2-\\frac{1}{3}-0 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}(\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2-1).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-93fd6742-7170-5522-9954-f5c8bd0f65a6"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-93fd6742-7170-5522-9954-f5c8bd0f65a6" :answer-field/id #uuid "93fd6742-7170-5522-9954-f5c8bd0f65a6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-edd19e76-dcf2-5721-a377-64323522bc6a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-edd19e76-dcf2-5721-a377-64323522bc6a" "answer-ef3563a9-4100-54a7-b530-a404469d2003" "answer-53242edd-a396-563b-8aa5-73886a38edb8" "answer-ccb51c3e-f35f-58f3-8931-5422fe5d6f4e" "answer-51e15788-2fff-568a-a3d7-e43b6c609b8c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-edd19e76-dcf2-5721-a377-64323522bc6a" :answer/id #uuid "edd19e76-dcf2-5721-a377-64323522bc6a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}(\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2-1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ef3563a9-4100-54a7-b530-a404469d2003" :answer/id #uuid "ef3563a9-4100-54a7-b530-a404469d2003" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-53242edd-a396-563b-8aa5-73886a38edb8" :answer/id #uuid "53242edd-a396-563b-8aa5-73886a38edb8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2+\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ccb51c3e-f35f-58f3-8931-5422fe5d6f4e" :answer/id #uuid "ccb51c3e-f35f-58f3-8931-5422fe5d6f4e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-51e15788-2fff-568a-a3d7-e43b6c609b8c" :answer/id #uuid "51e15788-2fff-568a-a3d7-e43b6c609b8c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2-\\frac{2}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-216e3ef8-6751-5e3e-9d7f-5d48b7476c3e" :question/id #uuid "216e3ef8-6751-5e3e-9d7f-5d48b7476c3e" :question/math-academy-id "q-97010" :question/problem "$\\int (\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x(2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+1)+\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x(2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-1))\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x={cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x.\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x={cosh}^{2}⁡x+{sinh}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\int (\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x(2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+1)+\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x(2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-1))\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & \\,=\\int (2{cosh}^{2}⁡x+\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+2{sinh}^{2}⁡x-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & \\,=\\int (2({cosh}^{2}⁡x+{sinh}^{2}⁡x)+\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & \\,=\\int (2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & \\,=2\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+C \\\\  & \\,=\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-b387d932-1baa-5085-8949-e65a26d02b68"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-b387d932-1baa-5085-8949-e65a26d02b68" :answer-field/id #uuid "b387d932-1baa-5085-8949-e65a26d02b68" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-208c24da-be3a-55c3-9799-185a231a9712" :answer-field/choices ["answer-64308c73-80b0-5749-9c4f-adff75e44307" "answer-b17c939b-7ee6-5751-a726-e418f1a0ea59" "answer-0126ad9c-e616-5191-8573-27abdacfd4c1" "answer-208c24da-be3a-55c3-9799-185a231a9712" "answer-2e98764c-cbfc-5c9b-944c-3ae0a975ef78"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-64308c73-80b0-5749-9c4f-adff75e44307" :answer/id #uuid "64308c73-80b0-5749-9c4f-adff75e44307" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b17c939b-7ee6-5751-a726-e418f1a0ea59" :answer/id #uuid "b17c939b-7ee6-5751-a726-e418f1a0ea59" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0126ad9c-e616-5191-8573-27abdacfd4c1" :answer/id #uuid "0126ad9c-e616-5191-8573-27abdacfd4c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-208c24da-be3a-55c3-9799-185a231a9712" :answer/id #uuid "208c24da-be3a-55c3-9799-185a231a9712" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2e98764c-cbfc-5c9b-944c-3ae0a975ef78" :answer/id #uuid "2e98764c-cbfc-5c9b-944c-3ae0a975ef78" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x-2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186167418 :question/problem "$\\int (3{cosh}^{2}⁡x+3{sinh}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x={cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x.\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x={cosh}^{2}⁡x+{sinh}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (3{cosh}^{2}⁡x+3{sinh}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 3({cosh}^{2}⁡x+{sinh}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\int ({cosh}^{2}⁡x+{sinh}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\int \\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+C \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186165716 :answer-field/correct "answer-40870649-16d6-5360-bf14-6f836b129bca" :answer-field/choices ["answer-af873597-e301-5597-826f-dfb57e5af612" "answer-ac790c7b-fa48-5ef7-bfd9-5febf5087850" "answer-c68a61fd-7366-5723-97a4-3ca62cbf1471" "answer-30277ee3-2cae-553d-a54d-a6b8aa645caf" "answer-40870649-16d6-5360-bf14-6f836b129bca"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-af873597-e301-5597-826f-dfb57e5af612" :answer/id #uuid "af873597-e301-5597-826f-dfb57e5af612" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ac790c7b-fa48-5ef7-bfd9-5febf5087850" :answer/id #uuid "ac790c7b-fa48-5ef7-bfd9-5febf5087850" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c68a61fd-7366-5723-97a4-3ca62cbf1471" :answer/id #uuid "c68a61fd-7366-5723-97a4-3ca62cbf1471" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-30277ee3-2cae-553d-a54d-a6b8aa645caf" :answer/id #uuid "30277ee3-2cae-553d-a54d-a6b8aa645caf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-40870649-16d6-5360-bf14-6f836b129bca" :answer/id #uuid "40870649-16d6-5360-bf14-6f836b129bca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186167421 :question/problem "Evaluate \n${\\int }_{0}^{1}({cosh}^{2}⁡2x+x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta =2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -1.\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2\\theta =2{cosh}^{2}⁡\\theta -1.\n$$\n\n \n\nRearranging, we have\n\n$$\n{cosh}^{2}⁡\\theta =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2\\theta +1).\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =2x$, we have\n\n$$\n{cosh}^{2}⁡2x=\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4x+1).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}({cosh}^{2}⁡2x+x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4x+1)+x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4x+\\frac{1}{2}+x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={(\\frac{1}{8}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4x+\\frac{1}{2}x+\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2})|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =[\\frac{1}{8}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4+\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot {1}^{2}]-[\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡0+0-\\frac{1}{2}{0}^{2}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4+1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186165734 :answer-field/correct "answer-a03198e4-2954-5f90-98d3-8f9c6bf9d6b6" :answer-field/choices ["answer-3dd8e5fb-866c-5c4f-bbe1-505f111e2e06" "answer-ba135342-aa32-522f-91d3-c61532567d63" "answer-3fc22d87-d8ca-5a08-812f-2e78dbb4b559" "answer-6220da56-2689-5ea4-b737-5a5f2d525da1" "answer-a03198e4-2954-5f90-98d3-8f9c6bf9d6b6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3dd8e5fb-866c-5c4f-bbe1-505f111e2e06" :answer/id #uuid "3dd8e5fb-866c-5c4f-bbe1-505f111e2e06" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4+6)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ba135342-aa32-522f-91d3-c61532567d63" :answer/id #uuid "ba135342-aa32-522f-91d3-c61532567d63" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4-2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3fc22d87-d8ca-5a08-812f-2e78dbb4b559" :answer/id #uuid "3fc22d87-d8ca-5a08-812f-2e78dbb4b559" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4+3)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6220da56-2689-5ea4-b737-5a5f2d525da1" :answer/id #uuid "6220da56-2689-5ea4-b737-5a5f2d525da1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a03198e4-2954-5f90-98d3-8f9c6bf9d6b6" :answer/id #uuid "a03198e4-2954-5f90-98d3-8f9c6bf9d6b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{8}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-6b367b19-8f35-5f68-a044-eb7b9764c38d" :question/id #uuid "6b367b19-8f35-5f68-a044-eb7b9764c38d" :question/math-academy-id "q-351903" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{2}}(4-3{cosh}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{5\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,-\\,$\n{{field-1}}\n$\\operatorname{sinh}⁡($\n{{field-2}}\n$)$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta =2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -1\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2\\theta =2{cosh}^{2}⁡\\theta -1\n$$\n\n \n\nRearranging, we have\n\n$$\n{cosh}^{2}⁡\\theta =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2\\theta +1).\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =x$, we have\n\n$$\n{cosh}^{2}⁡x=\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+1).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{2}}(4-3{cosh}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{2}}(4-\\frac{3}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+1))\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{2}}(\\frac{5}{2}-\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={(\\frac{5}{2}x-\\frac{3}{4}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x)|}_{0}^{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\  & =[\\frac{5}{2}\\sqrt{2}-\\frac{3}{4}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(2\\sqrt{2})]-[0-\\frac{3}{4}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡0] \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\sqrt{2}}{2}-\\frac{3}{4}\\,\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(2\\sqrt{2}).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-d3fdce0b-aebb-517e-8390-5a6aaec5bb75" "answer-field-e84af63e-7ff1-5d27-8af7-764ee61799ab"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-d3fdce0b-aebb-517e-8390-5a6aaec5bb75" :answer-field/id #uuid "d3fdce0b-aebb-517e-8390-5a6aaec5bb75" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-840a654a-86fc-5489-8324-6801e6feeda4" :answer-field/choices ["answer-840a654a-86fc-5489-8324-6801e6feeda4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-840a654a-86fc-5489-8324-6801e6feeda4" :answer/id #uuid "840a654a-86fc-5489-8324-6801e6feeda4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e84af63e-7ff1-5d27-8af7-764ee61799ab" :answer-field/id #uuid "e84af63e-7ff1-5d27-8af7-764ee61799ab" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-70b18141-2bee-5ae8-b9c2-69d17c5a68b9" :answer-field/choices ["answer-70b18141-2bee-5ae8-b9c2-69d17c5a68b9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-70b18141-2bee-5ae8-b9c2-69d17c5a68b9" :answer/id #uuid "70b18141-2bee-5ae8-b9c2-69d17c5a68b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-1ebb4c16-c258-518a-a825-ce276a761a9f" :question/id #uuid "1ebb4c16-c258-518a-a825-ce276a761a9f" :question/math-academy-id "q-351898" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}({cosh}^{2}⁡(\\frac{3x}{2})+1)\\,\\text{d}x=$ \n{{field-1}}\n$\\operatorname{sinh}⁡($\n{{field-2}}\n$)+\\,$\n{{field-3}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta =2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -1\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2\\theta =2{cosh}^{2}⁡\\theta -1\n$$\n\n \n\nRearranging, we have\n\n$$\n{cosh}^{2}⁡\\theta =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2\\theta +1).\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =\\frac{3x}{2}$, we have\n\n$$\n{cosh}^{2}⁡(\\frac{3x}{2})=\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡3x+1).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}({cosh}^{2}⁡(\\frac{3x}{2})+1)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}(\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡3x+1)+1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}(\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡3x+\\frac{3}{2})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={(\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡3x+\\frac{3}{2}x)|}_{0}^{\\pi /4} \\\\  & =[\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4})+\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{4}]-[\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡0+0] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}\\,\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4})+\\frac{3\\pi }{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-df5421c1-33c8-52c3-a934-b3f293d407a7" "answer-field-bc429605-87f5-544d-978a-0285dffc3203" "answer-field-72f2aba8-3ad3-5527-af94-606d696f3adf"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-df5421c1-33c8-52c3-a934-b3f293d407a7" :answer-field/id #uuid "df5421c1-33c8-52c3-a934-b3f293d407a7" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-de0c8485-931d-5e14-9d0b-1416b5ec8693" :answer-field/choices ["answer-de0c8485-931d-5e14-9d0b-1416b5ec8693"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-de0c8485-931d-5e14-9d0b-1416b5ec8693" :answer/id #uuid "de0c8485-931d-5e14-9d0b-1416b5ec8693" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-bc429605-87f5-544d-978a-0285dffc3203" :answer-field/id #uuid "bc429605-87f5-544d-978a-0285dffc3203" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-b7db4dc2-4afa-5530-8d81-ba6a2b0a54c7" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b7db4dc2-4afa-5530-8d81-ba6a2b0a54c7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b7db4dc2-4afa-5530-8d81-ba6a2b0a54c7" :answer/id #uuid "b7db4dc2-4afa-5530-8d81-ba6a2b0a54c7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3\\pi}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-72f2aba8-3ad3-5527-af94-606d696f3adf" :answer-field/id #uuid "72f2aba8-3ad3-5527-af94-606d696f3adf" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-2359ac3e-05f6-59cf-b866-9b382c762ab9" :answer-field/choices ["answer-2359ac3e-05f6-59cf-b866-9b382c762ab9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2359ac3e-05f6-59cf-b866-9b382c762ab9" :answer/id #uuid "2359ac3e-05f6-59cf-b866-9b382c762ab9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3\\pi}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-cf4092b0-8e64-55b4-94ba-2a8ea4d2ac81" :question/id #uuid "cf4092b0-8e64-55b4-94ba-2a8ea4d2ac81" :question/math-academy-id "q-165889" :question/problem "Evaluate \n${\\int }_{0}^{1/2}(3-2{cosh}^{2}⁡3x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta =2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -1.\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2\\theta =2{cosh}^{2}⁡\\theta -1.\n$$\n\n \n\nRearranging, we have\n\n$$\n{cosh}^{2}⁡\\theta =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2\\theta +1).\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =3x$, we have\n\n$$\n{cosh}^{2}⁡3x=\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡6x+1).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}(3-2{cosh}^{2}⁡3x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/2}(3-2\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡6x+1))\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/2}(3-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡6x-1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/2}(2-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡6x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={(2x-\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡6x)|}_{0}^{1/2} \\\\  & =[2\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(6\\cdot \\frac{1}{2})]-[2\\cdot 0-\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(6\\cdot 0)] \\\\  & =1-\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-345e42f3-499f-5ae0-9f6c-526a1f93142b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-345e42f3-499f-5ae0-9f6c-526a1f93142b" :answer-field/id #uuid "345e42f3-499f-5ae0-9f6c-526a1f93142b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-48807227-d099-5e79-866e-1ce8d84016ff" :answer-field/choices ["answer-0a6a86c9-5f1e-5b55-a779-0b27d17b9cb7" "answer-858ba711-5287-57e4-a23a-9253523a5ba9" "answer-48807227-d099-5e79-866e-1ce8d84016ff" "answer-133a3fb8-a470-51e3-9aa8-75064677269e" "answer-5c34cd29-1831-563e-a117-a4a9c3fbd985"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0a6a86c9-5f1e-5b55-a779-0b27d17b9cb7" :answer/id #uuid "0a6a86c9-5f1e-5b55-a779-0b27d17b9cb7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1-6\\operatorname{sinh}⁡3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-858ba711-5287-57e4-a23a-9253523a5ba9" :answer/id #uuid "858ba711-5287-57e4-a23a-9253523a5ba9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-48807227-d099-5e79-866e-1ce8d84016ff" :answer/id #uuid "48807227-d099-5e79-866e-1ce8d84016ff" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1-\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-133a3fb8-a470-51e3-9aa8-75064677269e" :answer/id #uuid "133a3fb8-a470-51e3-9aa8-75064677269e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5c34cd29-1831-563e-a117-a4a9c3fbd985" :answer/id #uuid "5c34cd29-1831-563e-a117-a4a9c3fbd985" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-12efb8aa-cbcc-5328-91fe-5d769b12ac7b" :question/id #uuid "12efb8aa-cbcc-5328-91fe-5d769b12ac7b" :question/math-academy-id "q-351902" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}({cosh}^{2}⁡x+3)\\,\\text{d}x=$ \n{{field-1}}\n$\\operatorname{sinh}⁡($\n {{field-2}}\n$)\\,+\\,$\n {{field-3}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta =2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -1\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2\\theta =2{cosh}^{2}⁡\\theta -1\n$$\n\n \n\nRearranging, we have\n\n$$\n{cosh}^{2}⁡\\theta =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2\\theta +1).\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =x$, we have\n\n$$\n{cosh}^{2}⁡x=\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+1).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}({cosh}^{2}⁡x+3)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}(\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+1)+3)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}(\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+\\frac{7}{2})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={(\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+\\frac{7}{2}x)|}_{0}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =[\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{2})+\\frac{7}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{2}]-[\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡0+0] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(\\pi )+\\frac{7\\pi }{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-b5630480-4fe9-588e-bdf0-1ee399688150" "answer-field-28a1cb41-1b5b-5d2e-ab6e-6d8b55c026eb" "answer-field-db14b8e4-522b-5e2d-8024-a70ac890758f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-b5630480-4fe9-588e-bdf0-1ee399688150" :answer-field/id #uuid "b5630480-4fe9-588e-bdf0-1ee399688150" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-04f2feab-92a8-538c-8fa0-8749a77b4343" :answer-field/choices ["answer-04f2feab-92a8-538c-8fa0-8749a77b4343"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-04f2feab-92a8-538c-8fa0-8749a77b4343" :answer/id #uuid "04f2feab-92a8-538c-8fa0-8749a77b4343" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-28a1cb41-1b5b-5d2e-ab6e-6d8b55c026eb" :answer-field/id #uuid "28a1cb41-1b5b-5d2e-ab6e-6d8b55c026eb" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-9dba3b70-c074-5458-a323-b19ef1d35432" :answer-field/choices ["answer-9dba3b70-c074-5458-a323-b19ef1d35432"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9dba3b70-c074-5458-a323-b19ef1d35432" :answer/id #uuid "9dba3b70-c074-5458-a323-b19ef1d35432" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\pi" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-db14b8e4-522b-5e2d-8024-a70ac890758f" :answer-field/id #uuid "db14b8e4-522b-5e2d-8024-a70ac890758f" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-4d3e5918-3dfe-5112-97f6-219db70ddf3b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-4d3e5918-3dfe-5112-97f6-219db70ddf3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4d3e5918-3dfe-5112-97f6-219db70ddf3b" :answer/id #uuid "4d3e5918-3dfe-5112-97f6-219db70ddf3b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{7\\pi}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-d0857a55-78b2-5e38-b682-a21c51974c3c" :question/id #uuid "d0857a55-78b2-5e38-b682-a21c51974c3c" :question/math-academy-id "q-352425" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round your answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}(2-12{sinh}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x=1-2{sin}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x=1+2{sinh}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above formula as\n\n$$\n{sinh}^{2}⁡x=\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x-1).\n$$\n\nWe can now integrate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}(2-12{sinh}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}[2-12\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x-1)]\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}(8-6\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(8x-3\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x)\\,{|}_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3} \\\\  & =[8\\operatorname{ln}⁡3-3\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)]-[0-0] \\\\  & =8\\operatorname{ln}⁡3-3(\\frac{{e}^{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}-{e}^{-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}}{2}) \\\\  & =8\\operatorname{ln}⁡3-3(\\frac{{3}^{2}-{3}^{-2}}{2}) \\\\  & =8\\operatorname{ln}⁡3-\\frac{40}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-b73b1863-d6f0-5b10-b3fa-815bfcf7b139"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-b73b1863-d6f0-5b10-b3fa-815bfcf7b139" :answer-field/id #uuid "b73b1863-d6f0-5b10-b3fa-815bfcf7b139" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-75c584e3-4715-56f3-957f-04a6776e7cb4" :answer-field/choices ["answer-75c584e3-4715-56f3-957f-04a6776e7cb4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-75c584e3-4715-56f3-957f-04a6776e7cb4" :answer/id #uuid "75c584e3-4715-56f3-957f-04a6776e7cb4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8\\ln(3)-\\frac{40}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-1ddb9340-9af2-51a6-8581-bb4c21f42fab" :question/id #uuid "1ddb9340-9af2-51a6-8581-bb4c21f42fab" :question/math-academy-id "q-97073" :question/problem "$\\int (4{sinh}^{2}⁡2x+3)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta =1-2{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2\\theta =1+2{sinh}^{2}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above formula as\n\n$$\n{sinh}^{2}⁡\\theta =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2\\theta -1).\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =2x$, we have\n\n$$\n{sinh}^{2}⁡2x=\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4x-1).\n$$\n\nWe can now integrate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (4{sinh}^{2}⁡2x+3)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (4\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4x-1)+3)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4x+1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4x+x+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4x+x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-b1ca330f-ffdf-51b2-9a3c-b44ad29a0d13"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-b1ca330f-ffdf-51b2-9a3c-b44ad29a0d13" :answer-field/id #uuid "b1ca330f-ffdf-51b2-9a3c-b44ad29a0d13" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-dcf14566-40b7-51bb-9c49-37e8d525189a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b605189f-b236-5c14-b566-17cbfac34bf9" "answer-a24b83cf-35df-57fb-bfe2-9bb91087aee8" "answer-f920fbe8-305f-58a8-bcd2-bef18daf9ece" "answer-dcf14566-40b7-51bb-9c49-37e8d525189a" "answer-b063029c-31ed-5fb8-bd08-c53673fc0531"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b605189f-b236-5c14-b566-17cbfac34bf9" :answer/id #uuid "b605189f-b236-5c14-b566-17cbfac34bf9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4x+5x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a24b83cf-35df-57fb-bfe2-9bb91087aee8" :answer/id #uuid "a24b83cf-35df-57fb-bfe2-9bb91087aee8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4x+x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f920fbe8-305f-58a8-bcd2-bef18daf9ece" :answer/id #uuid "f920fbe8-305f-58a8-bcd2-bef18daf9ece" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4x+x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dcf14566-40b7-51bb-9c49-37e8d525189a" :answer/id #uuid "dcf14566-40b7-51bb-9c49-37e8d525189a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4x+x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b063029c-31ed-5fb8-bd08-c53673fc0531" :answer/id #uuid "b063029c-31ed-5fb8-bd08-c53673fc0531" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{8}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4x+5x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-4b85bc81-6104-5328-b444-83c8973655d4" :question/id #uuid "4b85bc81-6104-5328-b444-83c8973655d4" :question/math-academy-id "q-352792" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{1}(8{sinh}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})-4)\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}\n$\\operatorname{sinh}⁡($\n{{field-2}}\n$)-\\,$\n{{field-3}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta =1-2{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2\\theta =1+2{sinh}^{2}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above formula as\n\n$$\n{sinh}^{2}⁡\\theta =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2\\theta -1).\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =\\frac{x}{2}$, we have\n\n$$\n{sinh}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})=\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x-1).\n$$\n\nWe can now integrate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}(8{sinh}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})-4)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(4(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x-1)-4)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(4\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x-8)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(4\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x-8x)\\,{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =4\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(1)-8\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-98cc11c0-aee2-5fda-a252-3022cc314d32" "answer-field-e0ee657f-8a91-5462-a83e-e961791c1d5e" "answer-field-b45263fa-64ca-5fca-a711-c9b1f2ec9306"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-98cc11c0-aee2-5fda-a252-3022cc314d32" :answer-field/id #uuid "98cc11c0-aee2-5fda-a252-3022cc314d32" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-a853eb43-35ad-5318-b3ea-fd258865a714" :answer-field/choices ["answer-a853eb43-35ad-5318-b3ea-fd258865a714"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a853eb43-35ad-5318-b3ea-fd258865a714" :answer/id #uuid "a853eb43-35ad-5318-b3ea-fd258865a714" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e0ee657f-8a91-5462-a83e-e961791c1d5e" :answer-field/id #uuid "e0ee657f-8a91-5462-a83e-e961791c1d5e" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-a0395874-ffc8-59ad-a520-d723c8af1b40" :answer-field/choices ["answer-a0395874-ffc8-59ad-a520-d723c8af1b40"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a0395874-ffc8-59ad-a520-d723c8af1b40" :answer/id #uuid "a0395874-ffc8-59ad-a520-d723c8af1b40" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-b45263fa-64ca-5fca-a711-c9b1f2ec9306" :answer-field/id #uuid "b45263fa-64ca-5fca-a711-c9b1f2ec9306" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-6ab22a23-f9cc-56d5-95ac-279199c70b5f" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6ab22a23-f9cc-56d5-95ac-279199c70b5f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6ab22a23-f9cc-56d5-95ac-279199c70b5f" :answer/id #uuid "6ab22a23-f9cc-56d5-95ac-279199c70b5f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-bc295d1d-76d5-5f67-a844-a3b5be954577" :question/id #uuid "bc295d1d-76d5-5f67-a844-a3b5be954577" :question/math-academy-id "q-352419" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round your answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}(6+6{sinh}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x=1-2{sin}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x=1+2{sinh}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above formula as\n\n$$\n2{sinh}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x-1.\n$$\n\nWe can now integrate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}(6+6{sinh}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =3{\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}(2+2{sinh}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3{\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}(2+\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x-1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3{\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3(\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x+x)\\,{|}_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2} \\\\  & =3(\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)+\\operatorname{ln}⁡2) \\\\  & =3(\\frac{{e}^{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}-{e}^{-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}}{4}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡2) \\\\  & =3(\\frac{{2}^{2}-{2}^{-2}}{4}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡2) \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{ln}⁡2+\\frac{45}{16}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a1d0a7db-40e9-524e-a61b-ec49a93196d2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a1d0a7db-40e9-524e-a61b-ec49a93196d2" :answer-field/id #uuid "a1d0a7db-40e9-524e-a61b-ec49a93196d2" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-43d13c05-6da4-5912-9d1f-919a238ff2db" :answer-field/choices ["answer-43d13c05-6da4-5912-9d1f-919a238ff2db"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-43d13c05-6da4-5912-9d1f-919a238ff2db" :answer/id #uuid "43d13c05-6da4-5912-9d1f-919a238ff2db" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\operatorname{ln}⁡2+\\frac{45}{16}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-12bc09cc-29a3-5e9b-995b-e577844956a7" :question/id #uuid "12bc09cc-29a3-5e9b-995b-e577844956a7" :question/math-academy-id "q-97085" :question/problem "Evaluate ${\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}(1-16{sinh}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x=1-2{sin}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x=1+2{sinh}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above formula as\n\n$$\n{sinh}^{2}⁡x=\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x-1).\n$$\n\nWe can now integrate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}(1-16{sinh}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}[1-16\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x-1)]\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}(9-8\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(9x-4\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x)\\,{|}_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2} \\\\  & =[9\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-4\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)]-[9\\cdot 0-4\\operatorname{sinh}⁡0] \\\\  & =9\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-4\\cdot \\frac{{e}^{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}-{e}^{-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}}{2} \\\\  & =9\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-2({2}^{2}-{2}^{-2}) \\\\  & =9\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-\\frac{15}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-0b2943f3-7b0e-5a8d-9f07-ea94989cfcbc"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-0b2943f3-7b0e-5a8d-9f07-ea94989cfcbc" :answer-field/id #uuid "0b2943f3-7b0e-5a8d-9f07-ea94989cfcbc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-b6be647a-f32e-58b3-b595-e16d7a2bc472" :answer-field/choices ["answer-2a2e8257-bfe6-5e3e-9807-69a66ed6f4c8" "answer-31ae5f0f-b924-5d5b-a2bd-1c8a5115b5af" "answer-6961d82f-9d68-5c51-9119-5d2172d51b6c" "answer-b6be647a-f32e-58b3-b595-e16d7a2bc472" "answer-0cc2ab74-5abc-5136-83a2-898739e322fd"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2a2e8257-bfe6-5e3e-9807-69a66ed6f4c8" :answer/id #uuid "2a2e8257-bfe6-5e3e-9807-69a66ed6f4c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-\\frac{17}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-31ae5f0f-b924-5d5b-a2bd-1c8a5115b5af" :answer/id #uuid "31ae5f0f-b924-5d5b-a2bd-1c8a5115b5af" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-\\frac{9}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6961d82f-9d68-5c51-9119-5d2172d51b6c" :answer/id #uuid "6961d82f-9d68-5c51-9119-5d2172d51b6c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-\\frac{11}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b6be647a-f32e-58b3-b595-e16d7a2bc472" :answer/id #uuid "b6be647a-f32e-58b3-b595-e16d7a2bc472" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-\\frac{15}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0cc2ab74-5abc-5136-83a2-898739e322fd" :answer/id #uuid "0cc2ab74-5abc-5136-83a2-898739e322fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-\\frac{21}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186168120 :tutorial/content "We can compute integrals containing hyperbolic functions using the hyperbolic counterparts of the trigonometric double-angle formulas. We use Osborn's rule to convert a trigonometric identity to a corresponding hyperbolic identity. \n\nOsborn's rule states that to convert a trigonometric identity to a corresponding hyperbolic identity, we\n\n- replace every trigonometric function with its corresponding hyperbolic function, and\n\n- for any product of two trigonometric sines, change the sign of the corresponding product of hyperbolic sines.\n\n$\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n        \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n        \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n        \\newcommand{\\sinh}{\\mathop{\\rm sinh}\\nolimits}\n        \\newcommand{\\cosh}{\\mathop{\\rm cosh}\\nolimits}\n        \\newcommand{\\tanh}{\\mathop{\\rm tanh}\\nolimits}\n        \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n        \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n        \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nFor example, let's consider the following integral:\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle{\\int} \\sinh x \\cosh x \\, \\textrm{d}x\n$$\n\n  \n\nNotice that the corresponding trigonometric integral is\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle{\\int} \\sin x \\cos x \\, \\textrm{d}x.\n$$\n\n  \n\nOne way of solving this trigonometric integral is to use the double-angle formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\sin 2x = 2\\sin x \\cos x\n$$\n\nApplying Osborn's rule, we get an equivalent hyperbolic identity:\n\n$$\n\\sinh 2x = 2\\sinh x \\cosh x\n$$\n\nRearranging the above formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{1}{2}\\sinh {2x}= \\sinh x \\cosh x.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, we can calculate our original integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:tutorial/validate]} {:db/id 17592186167028 :activity/expected-seconds 1260.0 :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186051482 :answer-field/choices 17592186051483] [:db/retract 17592186051482 :answer-field/choices 17592186051484] [:db/retract 17592186051482 :answer-field/choices 17592186051485] [:db/retract 17592186051482 :answer-field/choices 17592186051486] [:db/retract 17592186051482 :answer-field/choices 17592186051487] {:db/id 17592186054664 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-e75342f3-2efc-5d3d-a3c3-d44c19646c04"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186054992 :question/problem "![](images/ae/aee38b4fa46a403ee9517fc5a087434c8205b6553a4ebefa43be74ba7babfbc0.png)\n\nUsing the graphical method, find the solutions $(x,y)$ of the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}y=x+1 \\\\ y={x}^{2}+1\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The solutions $(x,y)$ of the system correspond to the intersection points of the two curves.\n\n![](images/56/563850386ee40e291a04911a2216614bda567ffbb8cfce1a7713400900d2701c.png)\n\nFrom the graph, the curves intersect at \n\n$\\,$ $(0,1)\\,$ and $\\,(1,2).$ \n\nTherefore, these are the solutions of the corresponding system." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186051482 :answer-field/correct "answer-0d132648-29c9-5efd-8dd9-74bc9443ede2" :answer-field/choices ["answer-2d56859a-7919-5fa1-b36a-db3eb7b258c0" "answer-9de3af1d-692f-5053-99f2-3783795f8e29" "answer-0144b8df-ea7b-5d97-a90d-b6a729498469" "answer-0d132648-29c9-5efd-8dd9-74bc9443ede2" "answer-dabcb025-40e7-5f2c-ae63-f8732b21b6f5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2d56859a-7919-5fa1-b36a-db3eb7b258c0" :answer/id #uuid "2d56859a-7919-5fa1-b36a-db3eb7b258c0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$(-1,0)$ and $(2,1)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9de3af1d-692f-5053-99f2-3783795f8e29" :answer/id #uuid "9de3af1d-692f-5053-99f2-3783795f8e29" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$(-1,4)$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0144b8df-ea7b-5d97-a90d-b6a729498469" :answer/id #uuid "0144b8df-ea7b-5d97-a90d-b6a729498469" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$(0,1)$ and $(-1,-2)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0d132648-29c9-5efd-8dd9-74bc9443ede2" :answer/id #uuid "0d132648-29c9-5efd-8dd9-74bc9443ede2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$(0,1)$ and $(1,2)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dabcb025-40e7-5f2c-ae63-f8732b21b6f5" :answer/id #uuid "dabcb025-40e7-5f2c-ae63-f8732b21b6f5" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$(1,0)$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186054665 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-1ecf42ce-06ef-5bfd-b762-67d3f1697496"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-1ecf42ce-06ef-5bfd-b762-67d3f1697496" :question/id #uuid "1ecf42ce-06ef-5bfd-b762-67d3f1697496" :question/math-academy-id "q-40946" :question/problem "![](images/e1/e1892e632e2485b17400ba9d2a9372bf164e20812c3b6fe4f9b03ab1348fab7d.png)\n\nUsing the graphical method, find the solutions $(x,y)$ of the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}y=f(x) \\\\ y=g(x)\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The solutions $(x,y)$ of the system correspond to the intersection points of the two curves.\n\n![](images/8d/8dfab4aa640e596227bd6a6a09af36264f6bce9bc0906a69ea433d6e6a3db78d.png)\n\nFrom the graph, the curves intersect at \n\n$\\,$ $(-1,1)\\,$ and $\\,(2,1).$ \n\nTherefore, these are the solutions of the corresponding system." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-8c0ebced-cf33-5e38-93fa-adaeaf32a0f9"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-8c0ebced-cf33-5e38-93fa-adaeaf32a0f9" :answer-field/id #uuid "8c0ebced-cf33-5e38-93fa-adaeaf32a0f9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-01a5189d-540f-5143-b180-eea39c520ccb" :answer-field/choices ["answer-1b84224c-2aef-5acf-9174-2e514405a489" "answer-01a5189d-540f-5143-b180-eea39c520ccb" "answer-aab67e8e-c1fd-5b7a-a619-a599bce9e1a3" "answer-7cc2dfcf-d574-5c58-9c7c-5fd06dbeeee6" "answer-1d898613-60f0-545a-a43b-ab2df0a31df5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1b84224c-2aef-5acf-9174-2e514405a489" :answer/id #uuid "1b84224c-2aef-5acf-9174-2e514405a489" :answer/type